  "description": "The whole telemetry record in one place: all three OTel signals the harness ships (traces + logs + metrics) arriving from service 'harness'. Traces and logs land in the 'default' stream; metrics arrive as Prometheus-named streams (dots become underscores, e.g. harness.invocations -> harness_invocations). Provisioned by demo/vault/run.sh under OPENOBSERVE=1; pinned to the OpenObserve dashboard v5 schema — bump it with the image (OPENOBSERVE_IMAGE).",
